      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kewanee%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Visitors can explore the Kewanee Historical Society, where exhibits trace the annexation of Wethersfield and the life of Civil War General John Howe.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
